<title>USA: U.S. DAP, ammonia little changed in quiet trade.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP, ammonia little changed in quiet trade.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diammonium phosphate and ammonia cash values showed little change Monday, and activity was minimal, traders said.</p>
<p>Most in the DAP trade were at the Southwestern Fertilizer Conference in New Orleans where many transactions for the fall season will take place, dealers said.</p>
<p>			    Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Friday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172-174		 unc-up 2</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  185-187		 dn 2</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		175		     unc</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
